-0.158, -0.105, -0.144, -0.184, -0.212, -0.321, -0.617, -0.965, -1.09, -1.067]}, "M": {}}, "early": {}, "ladder": {"state": "COUNTERTREND BOUNCE", "label": "COUNTER-TREND BOUNCE", "action": "HIGH-RISK \u00b7 NIMBLE ONLY", "dir": "caution", "score": -25, "why": "Short-term, a daily bottoming setup is forming \u2014 but the bigger picture is bearish (weekly momentum negative; investor cycle failed (broke its start low)). A bounce here is COUNTER-TREND: daily-cycle lows that don't line up with a weekly-cycle low tend to be left-translated and fail, then cascade toward the larger cycle low \u2014 exactly the trap of buying a daily low in a falling investor cycle. The daily cycle has already failed (broke its own start low).", "next": "Nimble traders only \u2014 small size, tight stop below 56.3. Not an investment buy; wait for the weekly timeframe to actually turn up (or a fresh investor-cycle low to confirm) before trusting it.", "weekly_ok": false, "regime": "bear", "regime_label": "BEARISH", "regime_why": "weekly momentum negative; investor cycle failed (broke its start low)", "regime_score": -3.0, "regime_line": "Bigger picture: BEARISH \u2014 weekly momentum negative; investor cycle failed (broke its start low) (investor cycle week 12 \u00b7 failed \u00b7 daily cycle broke its start low 10d ago).", "summary_line": "Short-term (daily): counter-trend bounce. Bigger picture (counter-trend): bearish.", "points": ["Bigger picture is bearish (counter-trend for a daily long)", "\u26a0 Failed cycle \u2014 price broke below the low that began this cycle (10d ago)", "Swing low printed (buyers rejected the low)", "Back above the 10-day average", "Daily momentum just crossed up"], "entry": {"tag": "BOUNCE \u2014 HIGH RISK", "tag_zh": "\u53cd\u5f39 \u2014 \u9ad8\u98ce\u9669", "urgency": "caution", "text": "Counter-trend bounce inside a bearish bigger picture. For nimble traders only \u2014 small size, tight stop below 56.3. If the daily low fails it cascades toward the larger cycle low; not an investment buy.", "text_zh": "\u5904\u4e8e\u770b\u7a7a\u5927\u5c40\u4e2d\u7684\u9006\u52bf\u53cd\u5f39\u3002\u4ec5\u9650\u7075\u6d3b\u4ea4\u6613\u8005\u2014\u2014\u5c0f\u4ed3\u4f4d\u3001\u5c06\u6b62\u635f\u7d27\u8d34 56.3 \u4e0b\u65b9\u3002\u82e5\u65e5\u7ebf\u4f4e\u70b9\u5931\u5b88\uff0c\u5c06\u5411\u66f4\u5927\u5468\u671f\u4f4e\u70b9\u8513\u5ef6\uff1b\u5e76\u975e\u6295\u8d44\u6027\u4e70\u5165\u3002"}, "cycle_plain": {"daily_line": "Daily cycle: day 52 of a typical 36\u201342 trading days", "daily_phase": "overdue \u2014 past the typical window, so a low could form any day", "daily_line_zh": "\u65e5\u7ebf\u5468\u671f\uff1a\u7b2c 52 \u5929\uff0c\u5178\u578b\u5468\u671f\u4e3a 36\u201342 \u4e2a\u4ea4\u6613\u65e5", "daily_phase_zh": "\u903e\u671f\u2014\u2014\u5df2\u8d85\u8fc7\u5178\u578b\u7a97\u53e3\uff0c\u4f4e\u70b9\u968f\u65f6\u53ef\u80fd\u5f62\u6210", "weekly_line": "Weekly (investor) cycle: week 12 of a typical 16\u201326 weeks", "weekly_phase": "mid \u2014 the bigger up-leg is maturing", "weekly_line_zh": "\u5468\u7ebf\uff08\u6295\u8d44\u8005\uff09\u5468\u671f\uff1a\u7b2c 12 \u5468\uff0c\u5178\u578b\u5468\u671f\u4e3a 16\u201326 \u5468", "weekly_phase_zh": "\u4e2d\u671f\u2014\u2014\u66f4\u5927\u7684\u4e0a\u884c\u6bb5\u6b63\u5728\u6210\u719f", "translation": "The last cycle peaked in its SECOND half ('right-translated') \u2014 strong cycles top late, a healthy-uptrend sign.", "translation_zh": "\u4e0a\u4e00\u5468\u671f\u5728\u540e\u534a\u6bb5\u89c1\u9876\uff08\u201c\u53f3\u79fb\u201d\uff09\u2014\u2014\u5f3a\u5468\u671f\u89c1\u9876\u504f\u665a\uff0c\u5c5e\u4e8e\u5065\u5eb7\u4e0a\u6da8\u8d8b\u52bf\u7684\u4fe1\u53f7\u3002"}, "early_note": "", "early_tier": null, "early_dir": null, "why_zh": "\u77ed\u671f\u6765\u770b\uff0c\u6b63\u5728\u5f62\u6210\u65e5\u7ebf\u7b51\u5e95\u5f62\u6001\u2014\u2014\u4f46\u5927\u5c40\u770b\u7a7a\uff08weekly momentum negative; investor cycle failed (broke its start low)\uff09\u3002\u6b64\u5904\u7684\u53cd\u5f39\u5c5e\u4e8e\u900